# ci deps for the advisory source-quality job: ruff replaces the unpinned
# astral.sh curl|sh installer; hypothesis backs the property-based fuzz tests;
# jsonschema>=4.18 backs the content-contract unit tests; pyyaml backs
# the route registry the tests import (runner images preinstall it, but
# the job must not depend on that).
